    "body": "Remove the `starship init` call from your shell configuration file (e. g. `eval \"$(starship init bash)\"` for bash), keeping starship out of your way. To uninstall it entirely, remove the package if you used Homebrew, Cargo or Scoop or remove the binary in /usr/local/bin if you installed it manually",
